      "shortest": false,
      "solution": "days = int(input())\nstem = input() \nlength = len(stem)\nnew_stem = list(stem)\n\npositions = [i for i, char in enumerate(stem) if char == '#']\n\nfor pos in positions:\n    left = max(0, pos - days)\n    right = min(length, pos + days + 1)\n    new_stem[left:right] = ['#'] * (right - left)\n\nprint(\"\".join(new_stem))",
